[[!meta title="Wiki"
        description="Notes, howtos and loose ends that do not fit a blog post."]]
Notes, howtos and loose ends that do not fit a blog post.  Pages are
written in [ikiwiki](https://ikiwiki.info/) flavoured Markdown: link
other pages with `[[PageName]]` or `[[some text|PageName]]`, and add
subpages under directories, e.g. `wiki/gis/gdal.mdwn` is `[[gis/gdal]]`.

